      "generatedCopy": "VS Code local automations can use cron schedules and custom agents. This guide shows how to check permissions, missed schedules and duplicate side effects before enabling recurring work.\n\nhttps://indieseek.co/blogs/vscode-1-145-local-automation-cron-custom-agent-safety-checklist/?utm_source=mastodon",
