      "targetUrl": "https://indieseek.co/blogs/vscode-1-145-local-automation-cron-custom-agent-safety-checklist/?utm_source=linkedin",
      "generatedCopy": "VS Code 1.145 makes local agent automations more useful—and more operationally serious.\n\nBefore adding a cron schedule, define what identifies one logical run, which actions may mutate external systems, how custom-agent changes are pinned, and what happens after a missed run or cancellation.\n\nThis guide turns those boundaries into a reusable preflight and release gate:\nhttps://indieseek.co/blogs/vscode-1-145-local-automation-cron-custom-agent-safety-checklist/?utm_source=linkedin&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=vscode-1-145-local-automation-cron-custom-agent-safety-checklist",
